# □ Day 2: Activate Flutterwave sandbox, test full payment flow
#          (create session → pay → webhook → fulfillment)
# □ Day 2: Switch Flutterwave to production keys when sandbox works
# □ Day 3: Activate Twilio (WhatsApp Agent), Telegram bot, ElevenLabs
# □ Day 3: Activate Resend (email) for receipts + notifications
# □ Day 5: LLM routing by plan is ALREADY implemented in lib/ai-runner.ts
#          (Starter→Groq, Pro→Claude Haiku, Business→Mistral Large, Enterprise→GPT-5)
# □ Day 7: Launch private beta with 20 pilot customers via WhatsApp/Telegram
