#   Month 6:  100 clients → MRR 900 000 FCFA ($1 500) → break-even
#   Month 12: 500 clients → MRR 4 500 000 FCFA ($7 500) → 70% net margin
#   Month 18: 1000 clients → MRR 9 000 000 FCFA ($15 000)
